  ('teach-pack-curriculum-planner-may', 'Curriculum planner Option 1 (May exams) — DSD', 'textbook', 'secondary', 'internal://sources-extract/curriculum-planner-option-1-may-exams-dsd.pdf', 2025, null, null, 'Suggested pacing for Year 1 core + ESP. Note: some planner pages show 100 marks for core papers; the 2025 Digital Software Development specification uses 90 marks per core paper — treat 90 as authoritative.'),
